cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "CourtVision: calibrated multi-sport forecasting with a leak-free validation harness and a published reject ledger"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shah
    given-names: Neel
    email: neeljshah22@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/neeljshah/court-vision"
url: "https://neeljshah.github.io/court-vision/analytics/"
abstract: >-
  An NBA-origin, multi-sport forecasting and decision-research system. The documented
  result is market efficiency: the pregame model matches the Shin-devigged closing line
  within noise on team-strength markets, and every candidate signal is recorded with its
  verdict, including rejects and retractions. Calibration evidence only; no edge claim.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - probability calibration
  - walk-forward validation
  - sports analytics
  - prediction markets
